{60分钟专用。通达信图形、选股周期均设60分钟；复权方式可选择前复权。}
{MA20是日线20日均线：前19个交易日收盘＋当前小时收盘。仅使用历史已完成数据。}
{技术公式不含2025年ROE股票池门槛，需在已核验ROE>10%的板块中选股。}
DIF:EMA(C,12)-EMA(C,26),COLORWHITE;
DEA:EMA(DIF,9),COLORYELLOW;
MACD:(DIF-DEA)*2,COLORSTICK;
JC:=CROSS(DIF,DEA);
GAP:=BARSLAST(REF(JC,1))+1;
D1:=REF(DIF,GAP);
P1:=REF(LLV(L,5),GAP);
P2:=LLV(L,GAP);
OLDEND:=REF(TIME,1)=1500;
SPAN:=SUMBARS(OLDEND,19);
DM20:=(SUM(IF(OLDEND,REF(C,1),0),SPAN)+C)/20;
READY:=BARSCOUNT(C)>=100 AND COUNT(JC,0)>=2 AND COUNT(OLDEND,0)>=19;
SIG:=READY AND JC AND DIF>D1 AND P2<P1 AND C>DM20;
LOFF:=LLVBARS(L,GAP);
PREOFF:=REF(LLVBARS(L,5),GAP)+GAP;
BASEV:=REF(MA(V,3),PREOFF);
RISK:=REF(V,LOFF)>BASEV;
DRAWICON(SIG,DIF,1);
DRAWTEXT(SIG AND NOT(RISK),DIF,'两金叉DIF背离'),COLORRED;
DRAWTEXT(SIG AND RISK,DIF,'背离：放量新低风险'),COLORYELLOW;
